WEBVTT

00:00:12.137 --> 00:00:14.222
I heard Osborn was defeated.

00:00:14.305 --> 00:00:16.182
That can't be true.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:20.061
He's lived for over two centuries
and is more or less a demon.

00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:22.105
There's no way he could ever lose.

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:25.025
You're wrong. He stood no chance.

00:00:25.108 --> 00:00:28.945
The messenger said the sorcerer
who defeated Osborn did so with Venom.

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:31.865
Wha… Wait. What? That's impossible!

00:00:31.948 --> 00:00:32.866
That spell,

00:00:32.949 --> 00:00:36.536
there's only one person in the whole world
who is capable of using it.

00:00:36.619 --> 00:00:39.664
And that man disappeared 15 years ago.

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:41.583
Darsh.

00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:46.296
We must verify the identity
of this wizard,

00:00:46.796 --> 00:00:48.798
and we should do so quickly.

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:50.383
In that case,

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:53.261
perhaps we should send out Kevidubu
to do the job.

00:00:53.344 --> 00:00:55.638
A Hydra summoner, huh?

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:56.973
Not a bad idea.

00:00:57.057 --> 00:00:58.433
If they can take down Kevidubu,

00:00:58.516 --> 00:01:01.186
then that means
they're wizard's the real deal.

00:01:01.269 --> 00:01:03.146
If it is who we think it is…

00:01:03.646 --> 00:01:05.273
We'll send our main army.

00:01:06.024 --> 00:01:07.734
Once we've stormed their gates,

00:01:07.817 --> 00:01:10.528
anyone who dares
to resist the Dark Rebel Army

00:01:10.612 --> 00:01:12.238
will be destroyed on sight.

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:17.577
We'll crush them
just like we did the Kingdom of Judas.

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:53.715
<i>Yoko. Hey, Yoko.</i>

00:02:59.971 --> 00:03:01.347
Hey, Yoko.

00:03:04.893 --> 00:03:06.853
L-Lucien?

00:03:07.604 --> 00:03:11.149
W-wait a sec.
How did you break the seal yourself?

00:03:11.232 --> 00:03:13.985
And why does it take you so long
to put on any clothes?

00:03:14.736 --> 00:03:15.945
Oh, come on.

00:03:16.029 --> 00:03:17.906
Is it a bad thing?

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:22.493
None of this is real. It can't be.

00:03:23.119 --> 00:03:25.622
I'm dreaming.
There's no other explanation.

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:27.582
Is that so?

00:03:27.665 --> 00:03:29.792
Look over there.

00:03:29.876 --> 00:03:32.045
Still think
this is just a dream?

00:03:32.128 --> 00:03:33.254
No! Father!

00:03:33.338 --> 00:03:35.715
Now take a look behind you.

00:03:35.798 --> 00:03:37.759
There are so many monsters here.

00:03:39.344 --> 00:03:42.180
Aren't they just the cutest things
you've ever laid your eyes on?

00:03:42.263 --> 00:03:44.557
-Stop it.
-Aren't they, Yoko?

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:48.228
No!

00:03:51.356 --> 00:03:52.649
RAMPAGE

00:03:53.233 --> 00:03:55.485
I-it was a dream.

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:58.112
Lucien.

00:03:59.864 --> 00:04:03.117
Seriously, do you listen
to anything I tell you?

00:04:03.201 --> 00:04:04.994
You're not supposed
to be sleeping in here,

00:04:05.078 --> 00:04:06.996
but you brought your pillow
with you again?

00:04:07.705 --> 00:04:10.625
It's all your fault
I had that weird dream, you know?

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.339
Come on, Lucien.

00:04:16.422 --> 00:04:18.258
Wakey-wakey.

00:04:35.483 --> 00:04:37.360
Lucien, food's ready!

00:04:37.443 --> 00:04:38.486
Okay.

00:04:40.154 --> 00:04:42.907
Make sure you chew your food
before you swallow it.

00:04:42.991 --> 00:04:45.076
Ugh.
You didn't chew your food enough.

00:04:45.159 --> 00:04:47.328
Ugh. Listen.
Kids who don't chew their food enough

00:04:47.412 --> 00:04:49.580
end up having weak jaws and teeth.

00:04:49.664 --> 00:04:51.457
Not to mention empty brains too.

00:04:51.541 --> 00:04:54.419
And there's food on your face.

00:04:55.003 --> 00:04:57.297
It's like you're
in kindergarten.

00:05:01.676 --> 00:05:03.761
Wha… what's that?

00:05:04.345 --> 00:05:06.389
Whoa. What a weird cloud.

00:05:06.472 --> 00:05:08.349
It's heading toward the castle.

00:05:08.433 --> 00:05:10.310
<i>Strange.</i>

00:05:10.393 --> 00:05:12.478
<i>I've got a bad feeling about this.</i>

00:05:13.646 --> 00:05:15.064
Yoko, Lucien.

00:05:15.148 --> 00:05:17.900
Oh. Father, it's you.
What's going on here?

00:05:17.984 --> 00:05:20.862
Do you know what that funny cloud
up there is, Great Priest?

00:05:20.945 --> 00:05:23.281
Yes. It's a bad omen.

00:05:23.865 --> 00:05:25.366
Now, follow me.

00:05:26.075 --> 00:05:27.827
We have to go to the castle.

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:29.162
Yes, Father.

00:05:29.245 --> 00:05:30.496
Yay! The castle!

00:05:31.164 --> 00:05:35.877
<i>If things go south,</i>
<i>then we may have to awaken him again.</i>

00:05:39.714 --> 00:05:41.382
What's that cloud?

00:05:42.258 --> 00:05:43.718
Keeps getting closer.

00:05:46.471 --> 00:05:47.472
What?

00:05:47.555 --> 00:05:50.183
Has Judas Castle truly fallen?

00:05:50.266 --> 00:05:51.309
Yes.

00:05:51.392 --> 00:05:55.104
The enemy invaded with a massive army
of demi-humans and monsters.

00:05:55.688 --> 00:05:58.524
Their wizard attacked us
with powerful magic spells.

00:05:59.067 --> 00:06:01.694
Our kingdom
could not fend them off any longer.

00:06:01.778 --> 00:06:04.072
They managed to defeat King Glen?

00:06:04.155 --> 00:06:05.656
But how is that possible?

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:09.118
Well, I wish I could say their path
of destruction ended at our kingdom.

00:06:09.202 --> 00:06:12.497
There are several of their units
marching toward here as we speak.

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:15.833
Uh, Your Highness,
our kingdom is in grave danger.

00:06:15.917 --> 00:06:18.002
The enemy approaching is an evil wizard!

00:06:18.086 --> 00:06:19.337
We must act quickly!

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:24.175
Are you suggesting that the black cloud
was created by some sort of evil spell?

00:06:24.258 --> 00:06:28.429
Correct, Your Majesty.
There is nothing natural about that cloud.

00:06:29.055 --> 00:06:32.308
Geo Noto Soto,
thank you for being here.

00:06:32.934 --> 00:06:35.061
I am Tia Noto Yoko.

00:06:35.144 --> 00:06:36.813
It is an honor, Your Highness.

00:06:36.896 --> 00:06:39.899
Aha! Yes.
You're the one who courageously stepped in

00:06:39.982 --> 00:06:43.778
to defeat the evil wizard
who attacked the castle while I was away.

00:06:43.861 --> 00:06:45.405
Thank you, my dear.

00:06:45.488 --> 00:06:46.531
And who is this?

00:06:49.367 --> 00:06:51.369
Oh. I'm Lucien. How did--?

00:06:51.452 --> 00:06:54.163
And he's Lucien Renlen.

00:06:54.247 --> 00:06:57.834
I never expressed my gratitude
for you saving us last time.

00:06:58.418 --> 00:07:00.169
But thank you for coming today.

00:07:01.212 --> 00:07:02.130
Hmm?

00:07:02.213 --> 00:07:04.465
He doesn't remember any of it,

00:07:04.549 --> 00:07:07.718
so there's no need
to feel obligated to thank him right now.

00:07:07.802 --> 00:07:08.928
I see.

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:13.266
<i>That must be the boy who serves</i>
<i>as the legendary wizard's vessel.</i>

00:07:14.267 --> 00:07:17.520
Now, then.
It is important that we make haste.

00:07:18.104 --> 00:07:19.355
Over the past several months,

00:07:19.439 --> 00:07:23.151
we've been detecting increased activity
from demi-humans and monsters

00:07:23.234 --> 00:07:26.487
in the wildlands bordering
the Kingdom of Meta-llicana.

00:07:26.571 --> 00:07:30.783
<i>It is due to rising levels</i>
<i>of evil pulse waves from the darkness.</i>

00:07:30.867 --> 00:07:33.953
<i>And now,</i>
<i>not only has the Dark Rebel Army appeared</i>

00:07:34.036 --> 00:07:36.080
<i>and destroyed the neighboring kingdom,</i>

00:07:36.164 --> 00:07:39.208
<i>but there is also a black cloud</i>
<i>settling over the lands.</i>

00:07:39.292 --> 00:07:41.294
All these bad omens.

00:07:41.878 --> 00:07:46.632
<i>I fear it's a sign of the resurrection</i>
<i>of the fearsome demon god, Anthrasax.</i>

00:07:46.716 --> 00:07:49.093
What? Did you say the demon god?

00:07:55.099 --> 00:07:59.395
Let's just see how strong this wizard
who supposedly defeated Osborn is.

00:07:59.479 --> 00:08:02.482
Regardless, they don't stand a chance
against me and my Hydra.

00:08:03.065 --> 00:08:04.442
Go, Hydra! Attack!

00:08:08.154 --> 00:08:10.156
I have new info to report.

00:08:10.239 --> 00:08:12.658
The enemy's Hydra
has breached the eastern gate.

00:08:12.742 --> 00:08:14.785
It's spitting flames
and destroying the whole city.

00:08:14.869 --> 00:08:16.496
-No. The whole city?
-The city too?

00:08:17.663 --> 00:08:18.664
A Hydra?

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:23.628
<i>Such a beast would never set foot</i>
<i>in a human settlement of it's own accord.</i>

00:08:24.128 --> 00:08:27.632
<i>This must be the work</i>
<i>of a powerful sorcerer.</i>

00:08:27.715 --> 00:08:30.510
There's only one way to beat the Hydra.

00:08:31.177 --> 00:08:34.472
<i>I really hope</i>
<i>this isn't going where I think it's going.</i>

00:08:35.515 --> 00:08:37.308
Dark Schneider.

00:08:37.391 --> 00:08:41.062
We must awaken Dark Schneider quickly,
so that he can save us.

00:08:41.145 --> 00:08:42.188
Yes. That's right.

00:08:42.271 --> 00:08:44.023
His magic is incredibly strong.

00:08:44.106 --> 00:08:46.234
It's sure to be enough
to get rid of that monster.

00:08:46.317 --> 00:08:48.361
Ugh. I fricking knew it!

00:08:48.444 --> 00:08:49.695
Please! We beg you!

00:08:49.779 --> 00:08:51.614
We need Dark Schneider.

00:08:51.697 --> 00:08:54.325
-No. I shouldn't. It's too dangerous.
-Please, Yoko.

00:08:54.408 --> 00:08:58.246
I refuse to awaken
such a cruel and disgusting man.

00:08:58.329 --> 00:09:00.039
Think of another solution.

00:09:00.122 --> 00:09:01.249
Yoko.

00:09:01.791 --> 00:09:03.626
We need Dark Schneider.

00:09:03.709 --> 00:09:04.544
Huh?

00:09:05.336 --> 00:09:07.755
Wizards like him are adept at using spells

00:09:07.838 --> 00:09:10.424
that can best other magic users
and monsters.

00:09:10.508 --> 00:09:13.427
Dark Schneider is our only hope
for winning here,

00:09:13.511 --> 00:09:16.514
which is why we need you
to do your part and awaken him.

00:09:16.597 --> 00:09:17.974
Excuse me?

00:09:18.057 --> 00:09:21.143
What about retaining my purity?
Don't I have any say in this?

00:09:21.227 --> 00:09:23.563
It's a kiss. Quit overreacting.

00:09:23.646 --> 00:09:26.440
Are you really gonna talk
to your own daughter that way?

00:09:30.861 --> 00:09:33.364
Are you going to wait
until I burn the whole city down

00:09:33.447 --> 00:09:35.032
before you show yourself?

00:09:35.116 --> 00:09:37.326
Come out,
come out wherever you are, wizard.

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:38.995
Or are you too scared?

00:09:39.078 --> 00:09:41.122
Oh no! We're all going to die here!

00:09:41.205 --> 00:09:43.207
Oh, Lord. I'm begging you to save us!

00:09:44.875 --> 00:09:46.419
So this is my life.

00:09:48.838 --> 00:09:49.880
Huh?

00:09:51.465 --> 00:09:55.303
<i>Well,</i>
<i>I don't really have a choice, do I?</i>

00:09:55.386 --> 00:09:57.722
Your face just got super red, Yoko.

00:09:57.805 --> 00:09:58.848
Yeah? So?

00:09:58.931 --> 00:10:01.601
Using this spell
takes a lot of concentration, all right?

00:10:01.684 --> 00:10:04.020
Just shut your mouth and sit quietly.

00:10:04.103 --> 00:10:05.062
Okay.

00:10:07.481 --> 00:10:11.152
I-I, uh, have a favor to ask.

00:10:11.235 --> 00:10:14.572
Could you maybe close your eyes, please?

00:10:14.655 --> 00:10:15.865
Just for a minute?

00:10:15.948 --> 00:10:17.491
Sure. If you want.

00:10:19.952 --> 00:10:21.078
Accept this.

00:10:21.787 --> 00:10:26.292
In the name of Ino Mata,
our beloved goddess of beauty,

00:10:26.876 --> 00:10:29.920
please break now this seal.

00:10:40.014 --> 00:10:42.183
I have returned!

00:10:45.978 --> 00:10:49.065
So then, this man is the legendary wizard.

00:10:49.148 --> 00:10:49.982
Yes.

00:10:50.816 --> 00:10:52.943
Dark Schneider…

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:55.112
<i>Lucien…</i>

00:10:58.449 --> 00:11:01.410
We are so grateful
to have you back with us, Dark Schneider.

00:11:01.494 --> 00:11:04.163
Our kingdom is on the brink of crisis,
and we need your help.

00:11:04.246 --> 00:11:06.457
We'll give you anything you want
in return.

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:07.416
That's right.

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:11.170
So go and use your magic
to annihilate the enemy. Hurry!

00:11:11.253 --> 00:11:12.672
I think I'll pass.

00:11:12.755 --> 00:11:14.382
What? What did you say?

00:11:14.465 --> 00:11:17.968
<i>Oh no. I knew this was a bad idea.</i>

00:11:18.052 --> 00:11:21.555
<i>I never should have awakened him.</i>
<i>He's even creepier than last time.</i>

00:11:21.639 --> 00:11:24.892
You bastard! We're ministers,
so you have to listen to us.

00:11:24.975 --> 00:11:26.686
Who do you think you are, huh?

00:11:26.769 --> 00:11:28.396
Such ungrateful swine.

00:11:28.479 --> 00:11:30.231
We said we would give you
whatever you wanted,

00:11:30.314 --> 00:11:31.941
so tell us what your price is!

00:11:32.024 --> 00:11:34.360
You really wanna know what I want?

00:11:34.443 --> 00:11:35.986
Listen up, you geezers.

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:39.448
I want everyone on this planet
to bow down to me!

00:11:40.616 --> 00:11:42.493
How original.

00:11:42.576 --> 00:11:44.286
And that's not all.

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:48.624
Hey, Great Priest.
I want your head on a platter.

00:11:51.085 --> 00:11:54.422
Don't just stand there.
Guards, capture that man!

00:11:57.299 --> 00:11:58.926
Guns N' Ro!

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:05.391
Your Highness, Princess,
it's dangerous here. Come this way!

00:12:07.351 --> 00:12:09.186
Geo Noto Soto.

00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:12.398
Fifteen years ago,
you were one of the Five Knights

00:12:12.481 --> 00:12:16.026
who got in my way
just as I was about to conquer the world.

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:20.698
Not to mention, you're also the one
who sealed me away after I was reborn.

00:12:21.198 --> 00:12:23.367
Well then, Great Priest,

00:12:23.451 --> 00:12:27.204
now that we're here face-to-face,
looks like it's payback time.

00:12:29.331 --> 00:12:33.294
It's been a long time,
hasn't it, Dark Schneider?

00:12:33.377 --> 00:12:35.671
You're starting to show your age.

00:12:35.755 --> 00:12:38.174
I'm sure you've enjoyed your life so far.

00:12:38.841 --> 00:12:42.303
And if you haven't, too bad.
It's time to die!

00:12:43.345 --> 00:12:45.347
<i>What's this evil aura I sense?</i>

00:12:47.057 --> 00:12:48.851
No way.

00:12:48.934 --> 00:12:51.729
It's so malicious, it's spooking all five
of the Hydra's heads.

00:12:52.313 --> 00:12:55.441
<i>I bet it's probably that wizard,</i>
<i>and he's in the castle.</i>

00:12:56.025 --> 00:12:57.902
<i>I finally found you.</i>

00:13:01.697 --> 00:13:05.201
Get ready because here I come, Geo.

00:13:05.284 --> 00:13:06.786
Stop, Lucien!

00:13:07.787 --> 00:13:10.039
I won't let you get away with hurting him.

00:13:11.248 --> 00:13:13.459
Why are you acting like this, anyway?

00:13:13.542 --> 00:13:15.252
You're supposed
to be helping us, so behave!

00:13:15.336 --> 00:13:16.253
Helping you?

00:13:16.337 --> 00:13:18.881
What the hell makes you think
that I owe you any more help?

00:13:18.964 --> 00:13:20.758
You're out of your damn mind!

00:13:20.841 --> 00:13:22.968
What did you say to me?

00:13:23.052 --> 00:13:24.386
What's the big idea?

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:25.971
You think you could just strong-arm me

00:13:26.055 --> 00:13:27.932
into doing whatever the hell
you want me to do?

00:13:28.015 --> 00:13:29.683
Please. Maybe it worked before,

00:13:29.767 --> 00:13:32.311
but don't expect me
to go along with it from here on out.

00:13:32.895 --> 00:13:36.065
<i>I already paid you back</i>
<i>for helping me the other day, remember?</i>

00:13:36.148 --> 00:13:37.608
<i>My debt is clear.</i>

00:13:37.691 --> 00:13:41.028
Killing your father is my first step
towards world domination,

00:13:41.111 --> 00:13:42.780
and there's nothing that can stop me!

00:13:44.198 --> 00:13:45.741
You little…

00:13:46.325 --> 00:13:48.244
I don't know who raised you
to act like that,

00:13:48.327 --> 00:13:49.745
but it for sure wasn't me.

00:13:50.246 --> 00:13:52.540
Please, forgive me.

00:13:52.623 --> 00:13:56.252
Huh? Hey. I told you
that crap won't work on me anymore.

00:13:56.335 --> 00:13:59.171
He's my mortal enemy,
and I can't let him live!

00:13:59.255 --> 00:14:01.215
So just shut up and step aside, Yoko!

00:14:05.094 --> 00:14:08.305
Slayer, slayer! Balmor!

00:14:08.389 --> 00:14:10.808
O, lightning of the dark darkness!

00:14:10.891 --> 00:14:12.393
That spell he's using…

00:14:12.476 --> 00:14:14.103
It's a lightning spell.

00:14:15.646 --> 00:14:16.814
Die, old man!

00:14:17.398 --> 00:14:18.899
Don't do it!

00:14:18.983 --> 00:14:20.860
Elel Namu Raibin!

00:14:20.943 --> 00:14:23.571
Oh, Spirit, I ask you to be my shield.

00:14:23.654 --> 00:14:24.780
Stryper!

00:14:24.864 --> 00:14:26.574
Balvolt!

00:14:32.079 --> 00:14:34.290
Huh?

00:14:34.373 --> 00:14:37.668
God protects all his children
who faithfully serve him.

00:14:37.751 --> 00:14:41.046
Which means your dark magic
is ineffective against me.

00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:44.466
Ugh.
An anti-magic shield, huh?

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:45.843
He's all right.

00:14:45.926 --> 00:14:47.970
Your spells are useless.

00:14:48.053 --> 00:14:50.139
They won't be able to break this barrier.

00:14:50.222 --> 00:14:52.558
Then your spells
can't go through it either!

00:14:52.641 --> 00:14:54.560
Did you consider that it works both ways?

00:14:55.185 --> 00:14:58.480
I guess that means we'll have
to switch to hand-to-hand combat.

00:14:58.981 --> 00:15:00.274
As I recall…

00:15:01.317 --> 00:15:04.153
Not only am I a priest,
I'm a warrior monk.

00:15:04.236 --> 00:15:08.115
I'm highly skilled.
Level 120 in the art of Holy Steel Fist!

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:11.035
Surrender.

00:15:11.118 --> 00:15:13.454
Not even someone
like the great Dark Schneider

00:15:13.537 --> 00:15:16.540
can keep using spells
without some sort of catalyst.

00:15:17.124 --> 00:15:19.376
Plus, I have this barrier, remember?

00:15:21.337 --> 00:15:24.506
I'm getting
a really bad feeling about this.

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:27.134
Stop lecturing me, you old man!

00:15:27.885 --> 00:15:29.762
Hmm?

00:15:31.805 --> 00:15:33.307
I once heard something

00:15:33.390 --> 00:15:36.268
about there being a golem hidden
deep underground

00:15:36.352 --> 00:15:37.978
below Meta-llicana castle.

00:15:38.062 --> 00:15:40.439
You bastard! How did you know?

00:15:40.522 --> 00:15:41.398
Easy.

00:15:41.482 --> 00:15:44.860
It's the same exact one
I used in the war 15 years ago.

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:49.657
Hmm? Oh no!

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:52.284
He's opening the magical channel
to the Golem!

00:15:52.368 --> 00:15:55.371
Mortal mortal dehlu dehlu fass.

00:15:55.454 --> 00:15:58.082
O, my loyal servant, heed my call.

00:15:58.165 --> 00:16:00.501
Your master asks you
to serve him once more.

00:16:00.584 --> 00:16:01.835
Hey! He must be stopped!

00:16:01.919 --> 00:16:03.712
We cannot let him cast that spell!

00:16:03.796 --> 00:16:05.589
It's far too late for that.

00:16:05.673 --> 00:16:08.008
The spell has been cast.

00:16:08.509 --> 00:16:10.719
Now, awaken, golem!

00:16:13.055 --> 00:16:17.267
Rise from your prison
and come to me, my servant! Do my bidding!

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:23.273
Use your power to destroy anything
that dares to stand in my way!

00:16:23.857 --> 00:16:25.234
What do you think, Geo?

00:16:25.317 --> 00:16:27.987
You may be able
to block my magic with that barrier,

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:30.197
but you can't block my golem's kick.

00:16:30.781 --> 00:16:32.825
And it's kick weighs a million tons,

00:16:32.908 --> 00:16:35.035
so good luck trying to survive it.

00:16:38.205 --> 00:16:39.540
Ugh!

00:16:39.623 --> 00:16:42.751
A Hydra already destroyed the city,
and now this happens?

00:16:42.835 --> 00:16:46.213
This exact scenario is why I told you not
to awaken Dark Schneider.

00:16:46.296 --> 00:16:48.340
-I said the same thing as well.
-Yeah. Me too.

00:16:52.302 --> 00:16:55.681
It's over for you now, Great Priest.
Time to meet your maker.

00:16:55.764 --> 00:16:58.809
It's starting to move!
Men, do something!

00:16:59.393 --> 00:17:01.353
Well, this isn't good.

00:17:01.854 --> 00:17:04.481
<i>We have</i>
<i>to put an end to this.</i>

00:17:04.565 --> 00:17:06.275
<i>I've gotta stop him,</i>

00:17:06.358 --> 00:17:10.696
<i>but… but I'm so scared my legs won't move.</i>

00:17:15.659 --> 00:17:17.161
Die, die, die, die!

00:17:17.244 --> 00:17:18.746
I'll kill you all!

00:17:18.829 --> 00:17:20.789
<i>He can't really be Lucien, can he?</i>

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:24.084
<i>This man takes pleasure in killing people</i>

00:17:24.168 --> 00:17:28.005
<i>and causing as much destruction</i>
<i>as possible for no reason.</i>

00:17:28.088 --> 00:17:29.089
<i>There's no way.</i>

00:17:29.715 --> 00:17:31.592
<i>They can't be the same person.</i>

00:17:32.301 --> 00:17:35.012
<i>The Lucien I know is sweet and innocent.</i>

00:17:35.095 --> 00:17:36.638
<i>He'd never hurt a fly.</i>

00:17:38.057 --> 00:17:39.099
Please…

00:17:39.183 --> 00:17:40.726
<i>Somebody stop him.</i>

00:17:40.809 --> 00:17:43.687
<i>I want him to go back</i>
<i>to the Lucien I know.</i>

00:17:49.818 --> 00:17:53.197
You were in the castle
like I knew you'd be.

00:17:53.280 --> 00:17:55.991
<i>You were not what I meant</i>
<i>when I asked for help.</i>

00:17:56.075 --> 00:17:57.201
<i>Ugh! This is hopeless!</i>

00:17:57.785 --> 00:17:59.828
Hmm. So it's you, huh?

00:17:59.912 --> 00:18:02.456
You're the wizard
who supposedly defeated Osborn.

00:18:02.539 --> 00:18:06.418
Why don't you prove it by showing me
just how powerful you really are?

00:18:06.502 --> 00:18:08.921
Will this day get any worse?

00:18:09.004 --> 00:18:10.005
What do we do?

00:18:10.589 --> 00:18:13.383
I am the great and powerful Kevidubu!

00:18:13.467 --> 00:18:17.638
I am a disciple of the almighty wizard,
Kall-Su, of the Dark Rebel Army,

00:18:17.721 --> 00:18:19.723
and I've been destined
to conquer the world.

00:18:19.807 --> 00:18:21.725
Behold your future ruler!

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:24.394
What?

00:18:24.478 --> 00:18:26.313
Did he say what I think he did?

00:18:26.939 --> 00:18:28.524
<i>Did he say Kall-Su?</i>

00:18:28.607 --> 00:18:31.360
The Dark Rebel Army
is a force to be reckoned with.

00:18:31.443 --> 00:18:32.820
Allow me to show you.

00:18:32.903 --> 00:18:35.489
If you're expecting an easy fight,
then you should run!

00:18:36.865 --> 00:18:38.200
That hurts.

00:18:38.784 --> 00:18:41.161
You're gonna pay for that, pig face!

00:18:41.245 --> 00:18:42.746
<i>Pig face?</i>

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:44.289
Look!

00:18:44.373 --> 00:18:48.043
The debris from your stupid entrance
caused me to bleed.

00:18:48.544 --> 00:18:50.921
A loser like you has absolutely no right

00:18:51.004 --> 00:18:53.507
to threaten a dashing young hero like me.

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:56.552
I'll kill you for that,
so get your ass down here, right now!

00:18:56.635 --> 00:18:59.513
I'll show you
"a force to be reckoned with."

00:18:59.596 --> 00:19:01.348
Let's go, fish lips.

00:19:02.641 --> 00:19:04.393
I don't have fish lips.

00:19:08.856 --> 00:19:11.859
Go to hell,
you insolent bastard!

00:19:13.777 --> 00:19:14.945
Go, golem!

00:19:27.207 --> 00:19:29.668
That thing overpowered
my monster!

00:19:29.751 --> 00:19:32.254
You desecrated my beloved Hydra!

00:19:32.337 --> 00:19:34.965
I'm going to murder you for that, wizard!

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:41.930
Oh, my beautiful face!
It hurts, it hurts, it hurts.

00:19:42.014 --> 00:19:44.308
That's nothing compared
to what's next.

00:19:44.391 --> 00:19:47.269
All right, asshole. Prepare to die!

00:19:48.437 --> 00:19:52.482
Zaazard,
Zaazard, Schrono, Chronossk.

00:19:52.566 --> 00:19:55.068
O, flames of hell,
burning in the depths of darkness…

00:19:55.152 --> 00:19:56.737
No! Please! Don't use that spell on me!

00:19:56.820 --> 00:20:00.574
…act as my sword
and slay all my enemies.

00:20:02.451 --> 00:20:03.660
Venom!

00:20:24.848 --> 00:20:28.560
Now, Great Priest,
don't think I forgot about you.

00:20:32.481 --> 00:20:34.149
See you in hell!

00:20:35.651 --> 00:20:37.194
No! That's enough!

00:20:42.449 --> 00:20:44.201
Stop it, please.

00:20:45.327 --> 00:20:46.370
Yoko…

00:20:46.453 --> 00:20:47.663
You're not him.

00:20:47.746 --> 00:20:50.791
You're nothing
like my sweet little Lucien.

00:20:50.874 --> 00:20:53.919
He would never treat people
the way I've seen you treat them.

00:20:54.002 --> 00:20:58.215
You really are that evil wizard
from 15 years ago, after all.

00:21:00.259 --> 00:21:01.593
Give him back.

00:21:02.177 --> 00:21:04.304
I want you to give Lucien back, right now!

00:21:09.935 --> 00:21:11.103
Uh…

00:21:11.186 --> 00:21:13.939
I… What are you talking about?

00:21:14.022 --> 00:21:16.066
I am Lucien. I swear it.

00:21:17.317 --> 00:21:18.568
Let me explain.

00:21:19.069 --> 00:21:22.072
The two entities known as
Dark Schneider and Lucien Renlen

00:21:22.155 --> 00:21:24.574
are just two sides of the same soul.

00:21:25.075 --> 00:21:27.703
If Lucien dies, so does Dark Schneider.

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:30.163
Whoever Lucien loves,

00:21:30.872 --> 00:21:32.207
I love them as well.

00:21:36.795 --> 00:21:38.255
Oh, fine.

00:21:39.047 --> 00:21:40.841
So, I see you don't believe me.

00:21:46.054 --> 00:21:47.222
I understand.

00:21:50.392 --> 00:21:53.770
<i>If Lucien dies, so does Dark Schneider.</i>

00:21:55.272 --> 00:21:58.525
<i>Whoever Lucien loves,</i>
<i>I love them as well.</i>

00:22:08.493 --> 00:22:10.495
Are you all right?

00:22:11.621 --> 00:22:12.706
Huh?

00:22:16.543 --> 00:22:17.419
Lucien!
